- Ask via AskUserQuestion only where the workflow calls for it (which run to analyze, an ambiguous match). If it is unavailable (headless / scripted), fall back to plain text and require an explicit answer. The skill writes nothing outside its own report, so there is no confirmation point — but never state or imply that you changed a plan, a status, or a log.
- Reply in the language resolved under conventions §7.6; load `*_zh.md` resources when it is Chinese. The report follows the plan's frontmatter `language` (else the language resolved under conventions §7.6); keep technical terms — metric names, log keys, file paths — in English inside Chinese reports.
